{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-act-13-1","title":"Acts 13:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Paul and Barnabas are chosen to go to the Gentiles. 6 Of Sergius Paulus, and Elymas the sorcerer. 13 Paul preaches at Antioch that Jesus is Christ. 42 The Gentiles believe; 44 but the Jews gainsay and blaspheme, whereupon they turn to the Gentiles, of whom many believe. 50 The Jews raise a persecution against Paul and Barnabas, who go to Iconium.</p>\n<p>Cir. A.M. 4049. A.D. 45. in the. 11:22-24; 14:26,27 prophets. 11:25-27; 15:35; Ro 12:6,7; 1Co 12:28,29; 14:24,25; Eph 4:11 1Th 5:20 Barnabas. 4:36; 11:22-26,30; 12:25; 1Co 9:6; Ga 2:9,13 Lucius. 11:20; Ro 16:21 which, etc. or, Herod's foster brother. Herod. Mt 14:1-10; Lu 3:1,19,20; 13:31,32; 23:7-11; Php 4:22 and Saul. 9; 8:1-3; 9:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-13-2","title":"Acts 13:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>they. 6:4; De 10:8; 1Sa 2:11; 1Ch 16:4,37-43; Ro 15:16; Col 4:17; 2Ti 1:11 2Ti 4:5,11 fasted. 3; 10:30; Da 9:3; Mt 6:16; 9:14,15; Lu 2:37; 1Co 7:5; 2Co 6:5; 11:27 the Holy. 10:19; 16:6,7; 1Co 12:11 Separate. 22:21; Nu 8:11-14; Ro 1:1; 10:15; Ga 1:15; 2:8,9; 2Ti 2:2 the work. 9:15; 14:26; Mt 9:38; Lu 10:1; Eph 3:7; 1Ti 2:7; 2Ti 1:11; Heb 5:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-13-3","title":"Acts 13:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the had. 2; 6:6; 8:15-17; 9:17; 14:23; Nu 27:23; 1Ti 4:14; 5:22; 2Ti 1:6; 2:2 they sent. 14:26; 15:40; Ro 10:15; 3Jo 1:6,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-13-4","title":"Acts 13:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>being. 20:23 Cyprus. 4:36; 11:19; 27:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-13-5","title":"Acts 13:5","author":"R. A.